(436590, 39951, 12448, '<td valign="top">???? Don''t get the irony in this one, really took me a second just to see the ring.  The picture itself is very good, nice colors, good cropping and the lighting is well done to me.</td>', '???? Don''t get the irony in this one, really took me a second just to see the ring.  The picture itself is very good, nice colors, good cropping and the lighting is well done to me.', '2003-10-01 10:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
