(437281, 39736, 7628, '<td valign="top">Fun capture - I like how the net is in focus and the balls not, follows in the theme of "no fun allowed"  Why not include th "C"?</td>', 'Fun capture - I like how the net is in focus and the balls not, follows in the theme of "no fun allowed"  Why not include th "C"?', '2003-10-01 18:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(437283, 39539, 3867, '<td valign="top">YES!!! I LOVE THIS PHOTO.  YOU STOLE MY IDEA!!!  After the barage of cutzie pet shots last challenge I wanted to submit one just like this!  Only problem is I couldn''t find a dead cat and the neibor''s live cat was took quick to catch with my truck! :) -10</td>', 'YES!!! I LOVE THIS PHOTO.  YOU STOLE MY IDEA!!!  After the barage of cutzie pet shots last challenge I wanted to submit one just like this!  Only problem is I couldn''t find a dead cat and the neibor''s live cat was took quick to catch with my truck! :) -10', '2003-10-01 18:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(437284, 39536, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice photo journalism.  Good framing.  Wish it was a bit clearer - is this just a case of resolution?</td>', 'Nice photo journalism.  Good framing.  Wish it was a bit clearer - is this just a case of resolution?', '2003-10-01 18:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(437286, 39919, 9441, '<td valign="top">nice photo...I like the rusticness about it...</td>', 'nice photo...I like the rusticness about it...', '2003-10-01 18:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(437292, 40255, 7628, '<td valign="top">Dramatic composition.  Stark lighting.  I''d crop out the trees on the bottom, they detract from the subject.</td>', 'Dramatic composition.  Stark lighting.  I''d crop out the trees on the bottom, they detract from the subject.', '2003-10-01 18:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(437293, 40362, 3867, '<td valign="top">No that''s what I call Irony.  Thanks for the laugh.  I think you might have a winner here.</td>', 'No that''s what I call Irony.  Thanks for the laugh.  I think you might have a winner here.', '2003-10-01 18:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(437295, 40276, 7628, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea,  the knives make a good subject, I wish I could see more of them better.  If the bowl and knives were set against a simpler background and the view was tilted up so we could see better...</td>', 'Interesting idea,  the knives make a good subject, I wish I could see more of them better.  If the bowl and knives were set against a simpler background and the view was tilted up so we could see better...', '2003-10-01 18:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(437303, 40266, 7628, '<td valign="top">interesting subject, makes you think,  I like your reverse effect - perhaps we are supposed to look at the image from different perspectives?  It all comes togetehr nicely.</td>', 'interesting subject, makes you think,  I like your reverse effect - perhaps we are supposed to look at the image from different perspectives?  It all comes togetehr nicely.', '2003-10-01 18:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(437304, 40229, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice candid,  Or at least it seems as real as if you happened to come upon this man unexpectedly.  Nice colors, light, I like the diagonal of the sidewalk - it balances things grafically, but also adds to the irony by making your eyes move through the picture while the subject snoozes.  A favorite.</td>', 'Nice candid,  Or at least it seems as real as if you happened to come upon this man unexpectedly.  Nice colors, light, I like the diagonal of the sidewalk - it balances things grafically, but also adds to the irony by making your eyes move through the picture while the subject snoozes.  A favorite.', '2003-10-01 18:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(437306, 40131, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice quality photo.  Good light, texture.  The subject doesn''t compell me, but it is very well done.</td>', 'Nice quality photo.  Good light, texture.  The subject doesn''t compell me, but it is very well done.', '2003-10-01 18:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(437308, 40233, 7628, '<td valign="top">Well shot, composed.  I like the contrast of the brightly colored bird to its dull surroundings - the colors match the substance of the picture, the mood.</td>', 'Well shot, composed.  I like the contrast of the brightly colored bird to its dull surroundings - the colors match the substance of the picture, the mood.', '2003-10-01 18:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(437309, 40123, 9411, '<td valign="top">Frankly, I don''t care if this is irony or not. I absolutely love this shot. The composition could be less centered and create more interest, IMO.<br/>I like the use of color, very appropriate. (yes, I''m a recovering catholic)</td>', 'Frankly, I don''t care if this is irony or not. I absolutely love this shot. The composition could be less centered and create more interest, IMO.I like the use of color, very appropriate. (yes, I''m a recovering catholic)', '2003-10-01 18:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(437310, 40333, 9809, '<td valign="top">base 1: 1/1; challenge: 1/3; technical: 1/3; aesthetics: 1/3; total: 4</td>', 'base 1: 1/1; challenge: 1/3; technical: 1/3; aesthetics: 1/3; total: 4', '2003-10-01 18:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(437312, 40378, 9809, '<td valign="top">base 1: 1/1; challenge: 0/3; technical: 1/3; aesthetics: 1/3; total: 3</td>', 'base 1: 1/1; challenge: 0/3; technical: 1/3; aesthetics: 1/3; total: 3', '2003-10-01 18:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(437313, 39821, 9411, '<td valign="top">I have a feeling this is a regional bit of irony. I like the light/colour on the pavement.</td>', 'I have a feeling this is a regional bit of irony. I like the light/colour on the pavement.', '2003-10-01 18:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(437314, 40350, 7628, '<td valign="top">A good idea.  Very ironic.  the composition feels awkward to me.  I''d like to crop at the left and get to see more of what is above the top edge.  It would help the viewer follow the idea of the picute better.  Perhaps a little more light at a different angle too?</td>', 'A good idea.  Very ironic.  the composition feels awkward to me.  I''d like to crop at the left and get to see more of what is above the top edge.  It would help the viewer follow the idea of the picute better.  Perhaps a little more light at a different angle too?', '2003-10-01 18:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(437315, 40028, 1368, '<td valign="top">I dont get the irony in this one?</td>', 'I dont get the irony in this one?', '2003-10-01 18:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(437316, 39951, 7628, '<td valign="top">well done technically - good subject.  I''d love to see a bit more smoke from the cigarette.</td>', 'well done technically - good subject.  I''d love to see a bit more smoke from the cigarette.', '2003-10-01 18:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(437317, 40242, 1368, '<td valign="top">Great shot Beautiful colors and angle Good job</td>', 'Great shot Beautiful colors and angle Good job', '2003-10-01 18:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(437319, 40351, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the reflections - very abstract composition. Interesting.  I''c crop a bit off the top.</td>', 'I like the reflections - very abstract composition. Interesting.  I''c crop a bit off the top.', '2003-10-01 18:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(437320, 40160, 1368, '<td valign="top">Yeah I bet you can fit a couple of steaks in there ;) Great angle good lightning and colors</td>', 'Yeah I bet you can fit a couple of steaks in there ;) Great angle good lightning and colors', '2003-10-01 18:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(437321, 40122, 7628, '<td valign="top">scary!  I like the dark doorways of shops and the foldes gate - all contrast well with the bright santa suit and add to the eerie effect of the empty suit.  Reality is harsh</td>', 'scary!  I like the dark doorways of shops and the foldes gate - all contrast well with the bright santa suit and add to the eerie effect of the empty suit.  Reality is harsh', '2003-10-01 18:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(437322, 40319, 1368, '<td valign="top">Great sign! This is funny But I think the picture is a little overexposured - 7</td>', 'Great sign! This is funny But I think the picture is a little overexposured - 7', '2003-10-01 18:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(437325, 40366, 9809, '<td valign="top">base 1: 1/1; challenge: 0/3; technical: 1/3; aesthetics: 0/3; total: 2</td>', 'base 1: 1/1; challenge: 0/3; technical: 1/3; aesthetics: 0/3; total: 2', '2003-10-01 18:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(437326, 39647, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice subject - good for challenge.  How did it look with color - too busy?  I wish there were more contrast in the sepia-tone - it is hard to see the line between the truck and sky.</td>', 'Nice subject - good for challenge.  How did it look with color - too busy?  I wish there were more contrast in the sepia-tone - it is hard to see the line between the truck and sky.', '2003-10-01 18:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(437327, 40259, 9809, '<td valign="top">base 1: 1/1; challenge: 1/3; technical: 3/3; aesthetics: 1/3; total: 6</td>', 'base 1: 1/1; challenge: 1/3; technical: 3/3; aesthetics: 1/3; total: 6', '2003-10-01 18:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
