(437364, 40376, 12719, '<td valign="top">excellet set up, really really nice. lovely colours too - I''d be interested to know how you did this one :)</td>', 'excellet set up, really really nice. lovely colours too - I''d be interested to know how you did this one :)', '2003-10-01 19:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(437365, 40054, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the b&amp;w with the brigh orange.  The color make the irony all the greater.  I wish it had a bit more dimension - iterally and figuratively.  Something meaning ful in the foreground or background would capture my interest more,</td>', 'I like the b&w with the brigh orange.  The color make the irony all the greater.  I wish it had a bit more dimension - iterally and figuratively.  Something meaning ful in the foreground or background would capture my interest more,', '2003-10-01 19:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
