(437369, 40340, 9809, '<td valign="top">base 1: 1/1; challenge: 0/3; technical: 1/3; aesthetics: 0/3; total: 2</td>', 'base 1: 1/1; challenge: 0/3; technical: 1/3; aesthetics: 0/3; total: 2', '2003-10-01 19:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(437370, 39979, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice composition against the black.  With better lighting and focus you could get a lot more detail outof the white shirt and the silver iron.  Is that steam coming out of the top?  It would look really cool if that were more obvious.</td>', 'Nice composition against the black.  With better lighting and focus you could get a lot more detail outof the white shirt and the silver iron.  Is that steam coming out of the top?  It would look really cool if that were more obvious.', '2003-10-01 19:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(437373, 40336, 9809, '<td valign="top">base 1: 1/1; challenge: 0/3; technical: 2/3; aesthetics: 1/3; total: 4</td>', 'base 1: 1/1; challenge: 0/3; technical: 2/3; aesthetics: 1/3; total: 4', '2003-10-01 19:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(437375, 40216, 7628, '<td valign="top">You need a subject with more dimensions.  While a periodic table is useful a photograph of one isn''t interesting.  I like the word play however.</td>', 'You need a subject with more dimensions.  While a periodic table is useful a photograph of one isn''t interesting.  I like the word play however.', '2003-10-01 19:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(437376, 40130, 9809, '<td valign="top">base 1: 1/1; challenge: 3/3; technical: 1/3; aesthetics: 0/3; total: 5</td>', 'base 1: 1/1; challenge: 3/3; technical: 1/3; aesthetics: 0/3; total: 5', '2003-10-01 19:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(437379, 39877, 7628, '<td valign="top">Where IS that offensive line?! I like the long shape of the shot.  It is hard to seee details from the distance and in the glare of the might lighting.  Those guys are moving fast too - but with that light you probably couldn;t use too fast a shutter speed.  You could use photoshop or somesuch to take the tilt out of the ground.</td>', 'Where IS that offensive line?! I like the long shape of the shot.  It is hard to seee details from the distance and in the glare of the might lighting.  Those guys are moving fast too - but with that light you probably couldn;t use too fast a shutter speed.  You could use photoshop or somesuch to take the tilt out of the ground.', '2003-10-01 19:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(437382, 40238, 12719, '<td valign="top">nice, I like the visual play here and it''s a nice change from the other ironing photos.</td>', 'nice, I like the visual play here and it''s a nice change from the other ironing photos.', '2003-10-01 19:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(437384, 40340, 12719, '<td valign="top">heh, dedicated follower of fashion?</td>', 'heh, dedicated follower of fashion?', '2003-10-01 19:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(437387, 40275, 7628, '<td valign="top">Chilly Pepers! Nice idea.  Wish you had included the bottom ends of the peppers in the frame, as well as the other pepper''s top.  Did you desaturate to remove the green?  A blue stem feels weird to my eyes.  Perhaps another point of light from a different level would bring out detail in the ice.  I really like your idea, just playing around with the details would make it much better.</td>', 'Chilly Pepers! Nice idea.  Wish you had included the bottom ends of the peppers in the frame, as well as the other pepper''s top.  Did you desaturate to remove the green?  A blue stem feels weird to my eyes.  Perhaps another point of light from a different level would bring out detail in the ice.  I really like your idea, just playing around with the details would make it much better.', '2003-10-01 19:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(437389, 40221, 7628, '<td valign="top">photo tells the stoy well.  Just enough details to understand.</td>', 'photo tells the stoy well.  Just enough details to understand.', '2003-10-01 19:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(437390, 40361, 12719, '<td valign="top">excellent, made me smile. thanks. I like the kind of poke at ''state the obvious instructions'' too.</td>', 'excellent, made me smile. thanks. I like the kind of poke at ''state the obvious instructions'' too.', '2003-10-01 19:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(437393, 40258, 7628, '<td valign="top">Funny subject.  Isn''t it true tho? Perhaps crop on the left, top and bottom a bit to simplify and draw the ye to the "lawn".</td>', 'Funny subject.  Isn''t it true tho? Perhaps crop on the left, top and bottom a bit to simplify and draw the ye to the "lawn".', '2003-10-01 19:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(437395, 40378, 7628, '<td valign="top">simple, effective. perhaps the clock face could be a bit less bright compared the the background.</td>', 'simple, effective. perhaps the clock face could be a bit less bright compared the the background.', '2003-10-01 19:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(437397, 39919, 7628, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  A subject that makes you curious, subtle colors, nice textues, well framed.  the rose gives a nice focus.</td>', 'Very nice photo.  A subject that makes you curious, subtle colors, nice textues, well framed.  the rose gives a nice focus.', '2003-10-01 19:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(437398, 40360, 9809, '<td valign="top">base 1: 1/1; challenge: 1/3; technical: 2/3; aesthetics: 0/3; total: 4</td>', 'base 1: 1/1; challenge: 1/3; technical: 2/3; aesthetics: 0/3; total: 4', '2003-10-01 19:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
