(437401, 40221, 12719, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but took me a while to get it cos it''s kind of fuzzy and also a rather busy composition.  shame, cos it''s a farily nice idea. if it didn''t have the title I''d stil be lost.</td>', 'nice idea, but took me a while to get it cos it''s kind of fuzzy and also a rather busy composition.  shame, cos it''s a farily nice idea. if it didn''t have the title I''d stil be lost.', '2003-10-01 19:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(437403, 40340, 7628, '<td valign="top">With all that light polution it almost makes sense to wear sunglasses at night.  I like the composition, I like how we can see the eyes, and how the hand is up to further shield the face.</td>', 'With all that light polution it almost makes sense to wear sunglasses at night.  I like the composition, I like how we can see the eyes, and how the hand is up to further shield the face.', '2003-10-01 19:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
