(437596, 40192, 9462, '<td valign="top">WoW, what a great railing. Not really ironic, more extraordinary.</td>', 'WoW, what a great railing. Not really ironic, more extraordinary.', '2003-10-01 20:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(437597, 40192, 10978, '<td valign="top">WOW, now that is just scary, but I am sure it was someones creative inspiration</td>', 'WOW, now that is just scary, but I am sure it was someones creative inspiration', '2003-10-01 20:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(437603, 40168, 5792, '<td valign="top">Clean, concise minimalist image. Technical quality high and a unique idea. Sometimes the simplest images are the best. You will probably get some low scores from folks that don''t see the irony in red ink coming from a green felt tip. This is one of the best of the challenge.</td>', 'Clean, concise minimalist image. Technical quality high and a unique idea. Sometimes the simplest images are the best. You will probably get some low scores from folks that don''t see the irony in red ink coming from a green felt tip. This is one of the best of the challenge.', '2003-10-01 21:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(437605, 40278, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good color andvery high  technical quality. Flame is not overexposed and the ice easily visible. Congrats on a great image.</td>', 'Good color andvery high  technical quality. Flame is not overexposed and the ice easily visible. Congrats on a great image.', '2003-10-01 21:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(437608, 39973, 3102, '<td valign="top">I had considered doing exactly this for my own shot!  You pulled it off very, very nicely.  Very nice &amp; simple.  Almost looks like an advertisement photo.</td>', 'I had considered doing exactly this for my own shot!  You pulled it off very, very nicely.  Very nice & simple.  Almost looks like an advertisement photo.', '2003-10-01 21:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(437609, 39600, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid I just don''t get this one at all... sorry...</td>', 'I''m afraid I just don''t get this one at all... sorry...', '2003-10-01 21:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(437611, 40227, 3102, '<td valign="top">Ha!  One of the few images in the challenge that made me chuckle!  Good find, indeed.  I might have tried showing more of the "Wulf" stone... something bothers me just a little about the composition.  Hard to say whether it would have been possible, but a straight on shot might have been cool, especially with the colorful foliage in the background.</td>', 'Ha!  One of the few images in the challenge that made me chuckle!  Good find, indeed.  I might have tried showing more of the "Wulf" stone... something bothers me just a little about the composition.  Hard to say whether it would have been possible, but a straight on shot might have been cool, especially with the colorful foliage in the background.', '2003-10-01 21:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(437612, 40308, 3102, '<td valign="top">I love the concept here!  It looks like the sky was desaturated, or something... the colors could have been a little stronger.  I might have simply shot the signs without the church -- I think the signs may have stood well enough on their own for this one.</td>', 'I love the concept here!  It looks like the sky was desaturated, or something... the colors could have been a little stronger.  I might have simply shot the signs without the church -- I think the signs may have stood well enough on their own for this one.', '2003-10-01 21:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(437613, 40169, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid the lighting really takes away from this one a lot.  The huge glare just dominates the shot, I''m afraid.</td>', 'I''m afraid the lighting really takes away from this one a lot.  The huge glare just dominates the shot, I''m afraid.', '2003-10-01 21:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(437616, 40362, 3102, '<td valign="top">Got a laugh out of me on this one...!  :)</td>', 'Got a laugh out of me on this one...!  :)', '2003-10-01 21:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(437618, 40028, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice framing and content. B&amp;W works well One of the best of this challenge. Very high quality image that evokes this question: If the irony in this is that you have not got high scores taking pictures with the 10D then what camera are you using to take this shot with? :)</td>', 'Nice framing and content. B&W works well One of the best of this challenge. Very high quality image that evokes this question: If the irony in this is that you have not got high scores taking pictures with the 10D then what camera are you using to take this shot with? :)', '2003-10-01 21:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(437621, 40356, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good technical quality. The rusted barbell weight makes a good subject. Your use of DOF is common with this type of closeup, though I generally don''t prefer the center focused variety like this. Putting the exact center of the barbell hole exactly at the upper left corner might add a touch to this very nice shot.</td>', 'Good technical quality. The rusted barbell weight makes a good subject. Your use of DOF is common with this type of closeup, though I generally don''t prefer the center focused variety like this. Putting the exact center of the barbell hole exactly at the upper left corner might add a touch to this very nice shot.', '2003-10-01 21:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(437622, 39483, 3306, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture. I happen to know that officer and he would no sooner throw you in jail than look at you. Don''t cross him. If he sees this picture he will be coming after you.  Be scared.....Be Very Scared.</td>', 'Awesome capture. I happen to know that officer and he would no sooner throw you in jail than look at you. Don''t cross him. If he sees this picture he will be coming after you.  Be scared.....Be Very Scared.', '2003-10-01 21:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(437624, 40132, 5792, '<td valign="top">Excellant perspective shot. Good use of DOF and well framed. Just a nice image all the way around. It meets the challenge particularly well.</td>', 'Excellant perspective shot. Good use of DOF and well framed. Just a nice image all the way around. It meets the challenge particularly well.', '2003-10-01 21:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(437626, 40362, 3306, '<td valign="top">The human race deserves this! Very original. Funny.</td>', 'The human race deserves this! Very original. Funny.', '2003-10-01 21:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(437628, 40352, 5792, '<td valign="top">Well framed image. Lighting is good and the dark background works well here. If you enhanced the black a little you can make the background solid black.  Glasses are a nice touch. Unfortunately, I think some small minded viewers will disagree with your supposition for this image and may vote it low as a result.</td>', 'Well framed image. Lighting is good and the dark background works well here. If you enhanced the black a little you can make the background solid black.  Glasses are a nice touch. Unfortunately, I think some small minded viewers will disagree with your supposition for this image and may vote it low as a result.', '2003-10-01 21:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(437630, 40308, 11432, '<td valign="top">I like the placement of the sign and the steeple, color is ok, a little grainy.</td>', 'I like the placement of the sign and the steeple, color is ok, a little grainy.', '2003-10-01 21:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
