(437933, 40249, 8522, '<td valign="top">Indeed ironic, shame the photo wasn''t lit better. Nasty amounts of noise in the background, along with a strong red/orange colour cast. Did you set the white balance? Avoidable glare from thermometer and pill packet. Not a strong composition. 3</td>', 'Indeed ironic, shame the photo wasn''t lit better. Nasty amounts of noise in the background, along with a strong red/orange colour cast. Did you set the white balance? Avoidable glare from thermometer and pill packet. Not a strong composition. 3', '2003-10-02 05:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(437934, 39979, 8522, '<td valign="top">May be irony, but not ironic. I hate puns anyway! Shame, as it''s a good photo. 4</td>', 'May be irony, but not ironic. I hate puns anyway! Shame, as it''s a good photo. 4', '2003-10-02 05:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(437935, 39736, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very amusing, made me laugh out loud. Far too much noise in picture though, and not lit particularly well. 5</td>', 'Very amusing, made me laugh out loud. Far too much noise in picture though, and not lit particularly well. 5', '2003-10-02 05:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(437937, 40278, 12425, '<td valign="top">This is a great pic.  Nice color, even the reflection of the ice adds to the pic.   What are the yellow dots in the top left of the flame - fabric highlighted by the fire?</td>', 'This is a great pic.  Nice color, even the reflection of the ice adds to the pic.   What are the yellow dots in the top left of the flame - fabric highlighted by the fire?', '2003-10-02 05:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(437938, 40126, 8522, '<td valign="top">I want to like this, but just can''t see the irony. I suspect you might get blasted by both people who score down cat pics AND people like me who can''t see the irony. It''s a shame the kitten isn''t more in focus, and the stray branch in the lower right hand corner is distracting. 3</td>', 'I want to like this, but just can''t see the irony. I suspect you might get blasted by both people who score down cat pics AND people like me who can''t see the irony. It''s a shame the kitten isn''t more in focus, and the stray branch in the lower right hand corner is distracting. 3', '2003-10-02 05:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
