(437958, 40052, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very amusing. Good shot, effective dof making your background work well. Nicely composed. Missing the wow factor for me though, 7</td>', 'Very amusing. Good shot, effective dof making your background work well. Nicely composed. Missing the wow factor for me though, 7', '2003-10-02 06:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(437959, 39647, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but there is just too much going on here to know what to focus on. To make a stronger picture, I think you should have composed the shot focusing on 1 element here. Maybe crop out the entire left half of the shot? I don''t think sepia toning works on this picture. Stark black and white would have worked better for me. 6</td>', 'Great idea, but there is just too much going on here to know what to focus on. To make a stronger picture, I think you should have composed the shot focusing on 1 element here. Maybe crop out the entire left half of the shot? I don''t think sepia toning works on this picture. Stark black and white would have worked better for me. 6', '2003-10-02 06:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(437965, 40360, 4258, '<td valign="top">hmmm... looks like some of the tobbaco fell off - that draws attention to the fact that the tip is not in sharp focus</td>', 'hmmm... looks like some of the tobbaco fell off - that draws attention to the fact that the tip is not in sharp focus', '2003-10-02 06:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
