(437971, 39646, 8522, '<td valign="top">Such a nice use of this awful pun, that I''ll overlook the description actually asked for something ''ironic''. Maybe I''ll overlook it because American irony is ironic (ho, ho, ouch)? Great composition, shame the highlights on the iron are a little burnt out. 7</td>', 'Such a nice use of this awful pun, that I''ll overlook the description actually asked for something ''ironic''. Maybe I''ll overlook it because American irony is ironic (ho, ho, ouch)? Great composition, shame the highlights on the iron are a little burnt out. 7', '2003-10-02 06:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
