(437980, 39973, 8522, '<td valign="top">Darn, my idea I never got around to carrying out. I''m glad I didn''t, because this is better than what I would have done, I''m sure. Great lighting... good to see you avoided glare on the can. Nice background, very effective. Good composition. Nice work. 8<br/>Edit: Incredibly, this is the only photo I gave 8+ to, making this my favourite and highest scoring picture.</td>', 'Darn, my idea I never got around to carrying out. I''m glad I didn''t, because this is better than what I would have done, I''m sure. Great lighting... good to see you avoided glare on the can. Nice background, very effective. Good composition. Nice work. 8Edit: Incredibly, this is the only photo I gave 8+ to, making this my favourite and highest scoring picture.', '2003-10-02 06:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
