(438374, 40384, 11800, '<td valign="top">There is a hot spot across the iron that is distracting. Maybe try using a different light source other than the flash.  Or try putting some thin white cloth over the flash to soften it a little. I like how the background is dark. Could be a nice abstract if you work with it a little more.</td>', 'There is a hot spot across the iron that is distracting. Maybe try using a different light source other than the flash.  Or try putting some thin white cloth over the flash to soften it a little. I like how the background is dark. Could be a nice abstract if you work with it a little more.', '2003-10-02 17:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
