(438378, 40362, 11800, '<td valign="top">Far Side. Good set up. Admire your dedication.  9<br/>Just a thought, since you can''t get his hooves on the wheel, did you think of leaving the door partially open so it looks like he''s just getting into the car?</td>', 'Far Side. Good set up. Admire your dedication.  9Just a thought, since you can''t get his hooves on the wheel, did you think of leaving the door partially open so it looks like he''s just getting into the car?', '2003-10-02 17:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(438380, 40361, 11800, '<td valign="top">The color of the bottle is really beautiful.  If the bottle was really clean, it would be much more convincing.  Using water twice on the label makes the idea more boring than it should be. Maybe, if you had used H2O, it would have been more funny.</td>', 'The color of the bottle is really beautiful.  If the bottle was really clean, it would be much more convincing.  Using water twice on the label makes the idea more boring than it should be. Maybe, if you had used H2O, it would have been more funny.', '2003-10-02 17:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(438383, 40221, 11800, '<td valign="top">classic.</td>', 'classic.', '2003-10-02 17:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(438384, 40319, 6870, '<td valign="top">Dark humor here, and well done.</td>', 'Dark humor here, and well done.', '2003-10-02 18:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(438385, 39850, 6870, '<td valign="top">I love the perspective of the road leading up. The sign on the right works well (as opposed to putting it in the middle). This image has nice tones.</td>', 'I love the perspective of the road leading up. The sign on the right works well (as opposed to putting it in the middle). This image has nice tones.', '2003-10-02 18:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(438386, 40308, 6870, '<td valign="top">The inclusion of the church balances well with the sign, both communicatively and thematically. It''s a little awkward, I suppose, but it works for me.</td>', 'The inclusion of the church balances well with the sign, both communicatively and thematically. It''s a little awkward, I suppose, but it works for me.', '2003-10-02 18:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(438387, 40052, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice face on this guy, too. He''s slightly out of focus, but well composed and a good idea!</td>', 'Nice face on this guy, too. He''s slightly out of focus, but well composed and a good idea!', '2003-10-02 18:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(438390, 40266, 11506, '<td valign="top">I tihnk it''s very hard to use the negative/inverted image to often come out better than the original.  However, I think you made a good choice here by using it.  The inverted sky REALLY brings out the foreground.  Nice job.</td>', 'I tihnk it''s very hard to use the negative/inverted image to often come out better than the original.  However, I think you made a good choice here by using it.  The inverted sky REALLY brings out the foreground.  Nice job.', '2003-10-02 18:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(438392, 39919, 7778, '<td valign="top">Now, what is a beautiful image like this doing in such company? Is the rose in hommage of the restaurator or to appease the hordes? My lonesome choice for blue.<br/> <br/>The irony here is not only intact but also cordial. :-) <br/></td>', 'Now, what is a beautiful image like this doing in such company? Is the rose in hommage of the restaurator or to appease the hordes? My lonesome choice for blue. The irony here is not only intact but also cordial. :-) ', '2003-10-02 18:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(438393, 39951, 11800, '<td valign="top">The symbolism is a little too subtle.  Self destruction should be pitted against self healing,  especially since the image is so intense. But, that is just my opinion.  The photo quality is one of the best in the challenge so far.</td>', 'The symbolism is a little too subtle.  Self destruction should be pitted against self healing,  especially since the image is so intense. But, that is just my opinion.  The photo quality is one of the best in the challenge so far.', '2003-10-02 18:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(438399, 40227, 11506, '<td valign="top">Ok, ok..  so I''m sitting here starring at this and saying I don''t get it.  But I''m determined to give each and every shot equal chances because I''ve only seen a few that are Irony and not just staged Oxymorons.  Then it hits me- WARE WULF!  Duh!!!   And I started laughing.  That''s great!  Nicely done!  Good colors too!</td>', 'Ok, ok..  so I''m sitting here starring at this and saying I don''t get it.  But I''m determined to give each and every shot equal chances because I''ve only seen a few that are Irony and not just staged Oxymorons.  Then it hits me- WARE WULF!  Duh!!!   And I started laughing.  That''s great!  Nicely done!  Good colors too!', '2003-10-02 18:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(438403, 40131, 11800, '<td valign="top">execution is perfect.  originality, well a little lacking.</td>', 'execution is perfect.  originality, well a little lacking.', '2003-10-02 18:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
