(438408, 40360, 11506, '<td valign="top">nice setup.  I would have like to see the front tip of the cigarette a little more in focus though.  <br/>PS-  there''s always lighters.</td>', 'nice setup.  I would have like to see the front tip of the cigarette a little more in focus though.  PS-  there''s always lighters.', '2003-10-02 18:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(438410, 39865, 11506, '<td valign="top">THIS IS GREAT IRONY!  Extra points for actually shooting Irony and not just a staged oxymoron!  It''s nice and clear.  I would have rather not seen the traffic and lady but oh well.  Nice job.</td>', 'THIS IS GREAT IRONY!  Extra points for actually shooting Irony and not just a staged oxymoron!  It''s nice and clear.  I would have rather not seen the traffic and lady but oh well.  Nice job.', '2003-10-02 18:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(438411, 40378, 7778, '<td valign="top">A little clichee, perhaps, but some things cannot be done often enough. <br/> <br/>Very simple and clear image, boldly persuasive. Given the demanding finesse of the challenge topic, this capture does what the bulk of competing entries fails to do: it speaks for itself without any need for a title. The title chosen here only -charges- this fact.<br/></td>', 'A little clichee, perhaps, but some things cannot be done often enough.  Very simple and clear image, boldly persuasive. Given the demanding finesse of the challenge topic, this capture does what the bulk of competing entries fails to do: it speaks for itself without any need for a title. The title chosen here only -charges- this fact.', '2003-10-02 18:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(438412, 40362, 11506, '<td valign="top">Nice shot all around.  Good colors and focus.  And clear Ironic point.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice shot all around.  Good colors and focus.  And clear Ironic point.  Well done.', '2003-10-02 18:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(438414, 40367, 11506, '<td valign="top">IS THIS REAL?!?!?  WOW!  Incredible!  If it is, you need to win this challenge just because of that ticket!  I''d blow up this shot and hang it on my wall at home so everyone saw how close I was!!!  As for the photo part, I''d have like to see the tv a little clearer, but I know how difficult it is to capture a electronic image so I''m not docking you any points.  Wow, I''d be swearing up a storm!</td>', 'IS THIS REAL?!?!?  WOW!  Incredible!  If it is, you need to win this challenge just because of that ticket!  I''d blow up this shot and hang it on my wall at home so everyone saw how close I was!!!  As for the photo part, I''d have like to see the tv a little clearer, but I know how difficult it is to capture a electronic image so I''m not docking you any points.  Wow, I''d be swearing up a storm!', '2003-10-02 18:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(438415, 40308, 11506, '<td valign="top">GREAT capture.  Extra points for it actually being Irony!</td>', 'GREAT capture.  Extra points for it actually being Irony!', '2003-10-02 18:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(438420, 40216, 11506, '<td valign="top">Whoa!  A little too close I think.  It blurred your image and added noise.  I''d guess that this is an equipment issue.  Know the limits of your camera.  Even less fancy ones will take great shots if they''re utilized right.  This shot is inventive and my guess is that you were trying to convey that Iron''s symbol has an E in it.  Next time I''d try backing off a bit or altering your prop ahead of time to make editing easier.  Hope this helps.  Good luck.</td>', 'Whoa!  A little too close I think.  It blurred your image and added noise.  I''d guess that this is an equipment issue.  Know the limits of your camera.  Even less fancy ones will take great shots if they''re utilized right.  This shot is inventive and my guess is that you were trying to convey that Iron''s symbol has an E in it.  Next time I''d try backing off a bit or altering your prop ahead of time to make editing easier.  Hope this helps.  Good luck.', '2003-10-02 18:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(438421, 39510, 11506, '<td valign="top">I like this, it''s making me hungry.  I wish the plate was a little more in focus though.</td>', 'I like this, it''s making me hungry.  I wish the plate was a little more in focus though.', '2003-10-02 18:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(438422, 40249, 11506, '<td valign="top">Very creative and inventive.  Plus the overall shot is nicely composed.  Good job.</td>', 'Very creative and inventive.  Plus the overall shot is nicely composed.  Good job.', '2003-10-02 18:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(438423, 40221, 11506, '<td valign="top">HAHAHA!  Nice setup.  At least I assume it''s a setup.  I''m wondering if the B&amp;W really does this shot justice though?  I''d like to compare it to the color.  I''m guessing I might like it better.</td>', 'HAHAHA!  Nice setup.  At least I assume it''s a setup.  I''m wondering if the B&W really does this shot justice though?  I''d like to compare it to the color.  I''m guessing I might like it better.', '2003-10-02 18:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(438424, 40277, 11506, '<td valign="top">They paved paradise and put up a parking lot!  nice shot.</td>', 'They paved paradise and put up a parking lot!  nice shot.', '2003-10-02 18:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(438425, 40276, 11506, '<td valign="top">nice knives- especially that one up front.  good focus on the bowl.</td>', 'nice knives- especially that one up front.  good focus on the bowl.', '2003-10-02 18:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(438427, 39951, 7778, '<td valign="top">Playful, humorous entry, apparently arranged to appeal to the cretin and one tuned to a finer sense. ;-)<br/> <br/>The dolphins, particularly as a title, is precisely the kind of ironic filigree which, IMHO, renders the bulk of competing entries irrelevant. <br/> <br/>A technically impeccable photo charged with an extreme and unusual topical attention.</td>', 'Playful, humorous entry, apparently arranged to appeal to the cretin and one tuned to a finer sense. ;-) The dolphins, particularly as a title, is precisely the kind of ironic filigree which, IMHO, renders the bulk of competing entries irrelevant.  A technically impeccable photo charged with an extreme and unusual topical attention.', '2003-10-02 18:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(438428, 40379, 11506, '<td valign="top">Ok, I''m looking at a few things here.  This looks like it was taken at night or dusk.  The taillight of the car in the upper left needed to be cropped out.  It jumps out at the viewer.  The number on the parking space (which is dead center) attracts my view as well.  Overall I think you may want to try sharpening the image a bit.  Hope this helps... good luck.</td>', 'Ok, I''m looking at a few things here.  This looks like it was taken at night or dusk.  The taillight of the car in the upper left needed to be cropped out.  It jumps out at the viewer.  The number on the parking space (which is dead center) attracts my view as well.  Overall I think you may want to try sharpening the image a bit.  Hope this helps... good luck.', '2003-10-02 18:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(438429, 40038, 11506, '<td valign="top">I think you made a mistake in cutting off his head (and elbow).  Otherwise, good focus all around.</td>', 'I think you made a mistake in cutting off his head (and elbow).  Otherwise, good focus all around.', '2003-10-02 18:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
