(438561, 39951, 10992, '<td valign="top">At first I thougt this was a message about double-suicide (killing yourself twice)...but after a moment I decided the irony was all these medications we take to improve our health, to feel better, to stay alive, etc. but then we kill ourselves with self-destructive behavior.  I really love the title!  It grabbed my attention and it was very unusual for a photo like this.  Nice contrasts, color, theme.  This is one of my favorites! 10!</td>', 'At first I thougt this was a message about double-suicide (killing yourself twice)...but after a moment I decided the irony was all these medications we take to improve our health, to feel better, to stay alive, etc. but then we kill ourselves with self-destructive behavior.  I really love the title!  It grabbed my attention and it was very unusual for a photo like this.  Nice contrasts, color, theme.  This is one of my favorites! 10!', '2003-10-02 23:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
