(439040, 40319, 12131, '<td valign="top">I love this shot not only for the main irony but there is something in haveing a grave with the visible word of Costley on it.  It''s true.  Death is both a dead end and costly.</td>', 'I love this shot not only for the main irony but there is something in haveing a grave with the visible word of Costley on it.  It''s true.  Death is both a dead end and costly.', '2003-10-03 19:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(439041, 39917, 12131, '<td valign="top">Wow, someone got really bored....or embittered.</td>', 'Wow, someone got really bored....or embittered.', '2003-10-03 19:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(439042, 39536, 12131, '<td valign="top">Wow, one hell of a storm blew through there!</td>', 'Wow, one hell of a storm blew through there!', '2003-10-03 19:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(439043, 40087, 12131, '<td valign="top">Hm, a boat out of water can be a very troubling thing.  Love the blend in the water where the sky meets the lake...or ocean?</td>', 'Hm, a boat out of water can be a very troubling thing.  Love the blend in the water where the sky meets the lake...or ocean?', '2003-10-03 19:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(439044, 40051, 12131, '<td valign="top">Oh no!  It''s happened! Now all that''s left is for hell to freeze!  Nice choice.  They''re very colorful and the crosses in the background can send loads of messages.</td>', 'Oh no!  It''s happened! Now all that''s left is for hell to freeze!  Nice choice.  They''re very colorful and the crosses in the background can send loads of messages.', '2003-10-03 19:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(439045, 39647, 12131, '<td valign="top">I think what makes this photo is the rail road sign hiding in the back.  That just adds tremendous impact.  (No pun intended.)</td>', 'I think what makes this photo is the rail road sign hiding in the back.  That just adds tremendous impact.  (No pun intended.)', '2003-10-03 19:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(439046, 40126, 12131, '<td valign="top">The kitty''s give you the looks of helplessness and playfulness, the cats give you surliness and sophistication with spurts of affection.  I love the expression on this kitty''s face.</td>', 'The kitty''s give you the looks of helplessness and playfulness, the cats give you surliness and sophistication with spurts of affection.  I love the expression on this kitty''s face.', '2003-10-03 19:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(439048, 40344, 12131, '<td valign="top">While I understand the irony, I don''t see it visibly without the title.  I do see a mixture of sunlight and rain clouds but the fact that it is a sunshine state doesn''t speak out clearly except perhaps in the form of the plants and tree in the picture.  The colors are nicely quiet lending a dreary atmosphere for more affect.  I hope that rain did you some good.</td>', 'While I understand the irony, I don''t see it visibly without the title.  I do see a mixture of sunlight and rain clouds but the fact that it is a sunshine state doesn''t speak out clearly except perhaps in the form of the plants and tree in the picture.  The colors are nicely quiet lending a dreary atmosphere for more affect.  I hope that rain did you some good.', '2003-10-03 19:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(439049, 40360, 12131, '<td valign="top">I don''t smoke but I understand the frustration in this.  Good choice.</td>', 'I don''t smoke but I understand the frustration in this.  Good choice.', '2003-10-03 19:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(439050, 40054, 12131, '<td valign="top">Yeah really, how do you get the maximum fine?  Not even doing all three offences will get you that much.  And isn''t reckless driving the same as speeding and tailgaiting put together?  Definitely a huh? sign.  Good choice.</td>', 'Yeah really, how do you get the maximum fine?  Not even doing all three offences will get you that much.  And isn''t reckless driving the same as speeding and tailgaiting put together?  Definitely a huh? sign.  Good choice.', '2003-10-03 19:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(439051, 39648, 12131, '<td valign="top">Now that''s confusing.  I hope no body got killed as a result.</td>', 'Now that''s confusing.  I hope no body got killed as a result.', '2003-10-03 19:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(439052, 40056, 12131, '<td valign="top">Highly amusing.  I once saw a lady with asthma take a puff off a cigarete, take a puff off her inhaler then take another puff of her cigerate.  Same thing here.  This is great.</td>', 'Highly amusing.  I once saw a lady with asthma take a puff off a cigarete, take a puff off her inhaler then take another puff of her cigerate.  Same thing here.  This is great.', '2003-10-03 19:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(439054, 40178, 12131, '<td valign="top">Very funny.  I like that.  But those drinks really don''t quite quiet your hypothalmus.</td>', 'Very funny.  I like that.  But those drinks really don''t quite quiet your hypothalmus.', '2003-10-03 19:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(439057, 39926, 12131, '<td valign="top">What''s more, why is someone outside the closed doors of a church?  Nice choice.  Very ironic.</td>', 'What''s more, why is someone outside the closed doors of a church?  Nice choice.  Very ironic.', '2003-10-03 19:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(439058, 40169, 12131, '<td valign="top">Exactly what do they do with so many utensils?  I never understood that, let alone not having the ones you need.  Just a thought, a place mat would have kept that shine down beneath the bowl.</td>', 'Exactly what do they do with so many utensils?  I never understood that, let alone not having the ones you need.  Just a thought, a place mat would have kept that shine down beneath the bowl.', '2003-10-03 19:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(439059, 40354, 12131, '<td valign="top">You, party animal, you!</td>', 'You, party animal, you!', '2003-10-03 19:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(439060, 40192, 12131, '<td valign="top">That''s the most creative house I''ve seen, except for one time I saw one made entirely of fence posts.  The chimney is what really speaks out.  It''s hard to tell if it is over the porch or in the house.</td>', 'That''s the most creative house I''ve seen, except for one time I saw one made entirely of fence posts.  The chimney is what really speaks out.  It''s hard to tell if it is over the porch or in the house.', '2003-10-03 19:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(439061, 39736, 12131, '<td valign="top">How do they expect anyone to get out?</td>', 'How do they expect anyone to get out?', '2003-10-03 19:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(439063, 40221, 12131, '<td valign="top">Oh, those sad moments when we''re caught with our foot in our mouths.  Love this shot.</td>', 'Oh, those sad moments when we''re caught with our foot in our mouths.  Love this shot.', '2003-10-03 19:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(439064, 40376, 12131, '<td valign="top">Well, so much for smoking.  The colors are nicely diverse within the realm of green.  It even lends the black a green tint.   Caught the flames nicely.</td>', 'Well, so much for smoking.  The colors are nicely diverse within the realm of green.  It even lends the black a green tint.   Caught the flames nicely.', '2003-10-03 19:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(439065, 40346, 12131, '<td valign="top">Little did they know what they were really doing making those glasses.  This could serve as a great commercial billboard for Pepsi.</td>', 'Little did they know what they were really doing making those glasses.  This could serve as a great commercial billboard for Pepsi.', '2003-10-03 19:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(439066, 39480, 12131, '<td valign="top">Wow...wow.............. ..... ..... wow.</td>', 'Wow...wow.............. ..... ..... wow.', '2003-10-03 20:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(439067, 40233, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors in the feathers of the bird. I really stands out from the background. Great contrast in the shot. The contrast on the feathers of the bird really give you a sense of the layering of the feathers. Also the reflections of the light and shadows in the cage really make it look 3D and helps give it a good depth of field.</td>', 'Beautiful colors in the feathers of the bird. I really stands out from the background. Great contrast in the shot. The contrast on the feathers of the bird really give you a sense of the layering of the feathers. Also the reflections of the light and shadows in the cage really make it look 3D and helps give it a good depth of field.', '2003-10-03 20:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(439068, 40340, 12131, '<td valign="top">I get the joke but the light above lends reason for the sunglasses.  As does the hand.  Might do better to angle the shot to miss that light post.</td>', 'I get the joke but the light above lends reason for the sunglasses.  As does the hand.  Might do better to angle the shot to miss that light post.', '2003-10-03 20:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(439069, 40277, 12131, '<td valign="top">Woaw, how did that happen.  Nice shot.  I like the mix of activity going on in this picture, the tree makes you look twice.</td>', 'Woaw, how did that happen.  Nice shot.  I like the mix of activity going on in this picture, the tree makes you look twice.', '2003-10-03 20:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(439072, 40123, 12131, '<td valign="top">Hm, someone got her intentions crossed (forgive the pun).  The dress really makes this too because it is so skanky and brilliantly purple where the rest of the shot is grayscale.</td>', 'Hm, someone got her intentions crossed (forgive the pun).  The dress really makes this too because it is so skanky and brilliantly purple where the rest of the shot is grayscale.', '2003-10-03 20:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
