(439139, 39926, 7151, '<td valign="top">Not sure what''s ironic.  I see the guy on the steps, but the down-and-out regularly go to churches for help.  The shot is a bit dark - otherwise just OK.</td>', 'Not sure what''s ironic.  I see the guy on the steps, but the down-and-out regularly go to churches for help.  The shot is a bit dark - otherwise just OK.', '2003-10-03 21:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
