(439145, 40319, 7151, '<td valign="top">Composition would have been better with the sign off center - to the right I think, would have lead the eye from the sign back to the graves.  Otherwise, an OK shot.</td>', 'Composition would have been better with the sign off center - to the right I think, would have lead the eye from the sign back to the graves.  Otherwise, an OK shot.', '2003-10-03 21:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(439147, 39978, 7151, '<td valign="top">Coral in a reef?  Not too ironic.  Oh, you''re refering to the phalic qualities of the coral.  And in a virgin reef.  OK.  Virgin males don''t have penises?  A bit of a stretch.  An OK shot of the coral, but a little tight cropping on the coral.</td>', 'Coral in a reef?  Not too ironic.  Oh, you''re refering to the phalic qualities of the coral.  And in a virgin reef.  OK.  Virgin males don''t have penises?  A bit of a stretch.  An OK shot of the coral, but a little tight cropping on the coral.', '2003-10-03 21:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(439148, 40028, 7151, '<td valign="top">I''m gonna check afterwards.  If your scores weren''t really lower after getting this camera, I''m gonna withdraw my vote!  ;)  A nice, somewhat low-key shot.  A couple of glares, but they''re pretty well controled.  I like the composition and the cropping.  Nice effort overall.  Assuming those lower scores...</td>', 'I''m gonna check afterwards.  If your scores weren''t really lower after getting this camera, I''m gonna withdraw my vote!  ;)  A nice, somewhat low-key shot.  A couple of glares, but they''re pretty well controled.  I like the composition and the cropping.  Nice effort overall.  Assuming those lower scores...', '2003-10-03 21:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
