(439470, 39536, 12681, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if this shot matches the category, but it sure is a good picture. First, it is a picture of opportunity. The colors and shading are good. The subject is startling and well presented in the center of the action. While the background is vast, the subdued colors keep the subject as center of interest. Very nice.</td>', 'I don''t know if this shot matches the category, but it sure is a good picture. First, it is a picture of opportunity. The colors and shading are good. The subject is startling and well presented in the center of the action. While the background is vast, the subdued colors keep the subject as center of interest. Very nice.', '2003-10-04 16:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
