(439728, 40216, 5728, '<td valign="top">I see what you are getting at here, it''s just that for me this isn''t photography taking a pic of a chart. But anyhow, on the technical side I would either have included those words at the bottom in your photo or left them completely out. Only having half of them there is a little distracting.</td>', 'I see what you are getting at here, it''s just that for me this isn''t photography taking a pic of a chart. But anyhow, on the technical side I would either have included those words at the bottom in your photo or left them completely out. Only having half of them there is a little distracting.', '2003-10-05 14:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(439729, 40375, 5728, '<td valign="top">I''d have gone for a uniform background, either white or black or a single color. The background you have really doesn''t do your photo much good.</td>', 'I''d have gone for a uniform background, either white or black or a single color. The background you have really doesn''t do your photo much good.', '2003-10-05 14:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(439733, 40227, 12733, '<td valign="top">Kind of cute irony; gorgeous colors and composition.</td>', 'Kind of cute irony; gorgeous colors and composition.', '2003-10-05 14:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(439735, 40266, 12733, '<td valign="top">Good catch, well executed.</td>', 'Good catch, well executed.', '2003-10-05 14:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(439740, 40310, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the rich colors, the bored expressions on the waiting passengers and the irony of a bus stop not in use. What are they waiting for, then?</td>', 'I like the rich colors, the bored expressions on the waiting passengers and the irony of a bus stop not in use. What are they waiting for, then?', '2003-10-05 14:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(439742, 40231, 12733, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, nice texture in the tree.</td>', 'Cute idea, nice texture in the tree.', '2003-10-05 14:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(439744, 40356, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very ironic. I think this shot would have benefitted from greater depth of field, or a main focus on the word barbell if that was not possible.</td>', 'Very ironic. I think this shot would have benefitted from greater depth of field, or a main focus on the word barbell if that was not possible.', '2003-10-05 14:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(439746, 40217, 12733, '<td valign="top">There''s a sharp, clean feel to this photo that''s almost like a painting. The juxtaposition creates a nice irony (too bad it''s not a chocolate shop!)</td>', 'There''s a sharp, clean feel to this photo that''s almost like a painting. The juxtaposition creates a nice irony (too bad it''s not a chocolate shop!)', '2003-10-05 14:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(439748, 40232, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice juxtaposition of signs and great texture, color and composition.</td>', 'Nice juxtaposition of signs and great texture, color and composition.', '2003-10-05 14:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(439749, 40248, 12733, '<td valign="top">Irony or just not quick enough? Anyway, it''s a great shot, wherever you ended up entering it.</td>', 'Irony or just not quick enough? Anyway, it''s a great shot, wherever you ended up entering it.', '2003-10-05 14:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(439751, 39973, 12733, '<td valign="top">As you can see from all the variations on this theme in this challenge, it''s something of a cliche. This is well executed and a clean composition - which many of the others are not.</td>', 'As you can see from all the variations on this theme in this challenge, it''s something of a cliche. This is well executed and a clean composition - which many of the others are not.', '2003-10-05 14:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(439752, 40123, 12733, '<td valign="top">Which is the greater irony, the handcuffs or the sexy outfit? Anyway, an interesting photo. Did you use a starburst filter to get the highlights off the jewelry?</td>', 'Which is the greater irony, the handcuffs or the sexy outfit? Anyway, an interesting photo. Did you use a starburst filter to get the highlights off the jewelry?', '2003-10-05 14:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(439753, 40000, 12733, '<td valign="top">The clutter on your desk may be part of the statement, but it tends to distract from the overall effect of the photo. I guess you figured out what it means!</td>', 'The clutter on your desk may be part of the statement, but it tends to distract from the overall effect of the photo. I guess you figured out what it means!', '2003-10-05 14:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(439754, 40178, 12733, '<td valign="top">A nice still life illustrates an irony that is something of a cliche (look at all the entries on this theme). This makes a nice picture, but a tighter crop to get rid of some of the distracting background might have made it even better.</td>', 'A nice still life illustrates an irony that is something of a cliche (look at all the entries on this theme). This makes a nice picture, but a tighter crop to get rid of some of the distracting background might have made it even better.', '2003-10-05 14:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(439755, 40362, 12733, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, nicely done.</td>', 'Cute idea, nicely done.', '2003-10-05 14:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(439757, 40122, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice ironic combination of elements. The title offers simplicity and a comment on what the picture shows - it''s not overdone.</td>', 'Nice ironic combination of elements. The title offers simplicity and a comment on what the picture shows - it''s not overdone.', '2003-10-05 14:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(439758, 40278, 12733, '<td valign="top">Wow, a spectacular shot. Is that really ice, or something that just looks like ice (frozen lighter fluid)?</td>', 'Wow, a spectacular shot. Is that really ice, or something that just looks like ice (frozen lighter fluid)?', '2003-10-05 14:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(439759, 39648, 12733, '<td valign="top">Yeah, I guess it''s time to just stop. I think this shot would be more effective with less tree and more road, possibly a car on the road - and best of all if its left turn signal was going.</td>', 'Yeah, I guess it''s time to just stop. I think this shot would be more effective with less tree and more road, possibly a car on the road - and best of all if its left turn signal was going.', '2003-10-05 14:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(439760, 40360, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nah! Smokers are more resourceful than that. Nice composition and execution.</td>', 'Nah! Smokers are more resourceful than that. Nice composition and execution.', '2003-10-05 15:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(439761, 40215, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice macro shot. Are these really sprinkles? They could be tomatoes (one that didn''t ripen) or oranges or any one several other things. The shot is effective, and I''m not even sure why.</td>', 'Nice macro shot. Are these really sprinkles? They could be tomatoes (one that didn''t ripen) or oranges or any one several other things. The shot is effective, and I''m not even sure why.', '2003-10-05 15:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(439762, 40192, 12733, '<td valign="top">Is it the polished curved wood trim on the porch or the odd position of the chimney or both or something else that makes this cabin seem so incongruous. Nice shot, whatever it is.</td>', 'Is it the polished curved wood trim on the porch or the odd position of the chimney or both or something else that makes this cabin seem so incongruous. Nice shot, whatever it is.', '2003-10-05 15:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
