(439771, 40169, 12733, '<td valign="top">You''re spozed to slurp your soup! Nicely arranged still life. Was the spot of glare in the foreground intentional? I find it a bit distracting.</td>', 'You''re spozed to slurp your soup! Nicely arranged still life. Was the spot of glare in the foreground intentional? I find it a bit distracting.', '2003-10-05 15:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(439772, 40136, 12733, '<td valign="top">Good concept, and a well thought out shot. I think it needs tighter cropping - all that black at the top doesn''t really add anything.</td>', 'Good concept, and a well thought out shot. I think it needs tighter cropping - all that black at the top doesn''t really add anything.', '2003-10-05 15:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(439773, 40319, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice find, nice shot. The graves make a nice compostion, and the granite texture contrasts nicely with the grass.</td>', 'Nice find, nice shot. The graves make a nice compostion, and the granite texture contrasts nicely with the grass.', '2003-10-05 15:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(439775, 40365, 12733, '<td valign="top">Of course, as soon as I saw this photo I had to pull out a bill and try it. Nice closeup - I think I would have tried to figure out a way to hold the bill in place without those out-of-focus fingers at the edges (scotch tape on the back of the surfaces, for instance).</td>', 'Of course, as soon as I saw this photo I had to pull out a bill and try it. Nice closeup - I think I would have tried to figure out a way to hold the bill in place without those out-of-focus fingers at the edges (scotch tape on the back of the surfaces, for instance).', '2003-10-05 15:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(439777, 40365, 6306, '<td valign="top">Would have been better without the fingers in the image</td>', 'Would have been better without the fingers in the image', '2003-10-05 15:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(439779, 40132, 12733, '<td valign="top">The angle makes this photo really eye-catching. The lockout and the sign together provide the irony. I also like the contrast of texture between the metal sign and the brick.</td>', 'The angle makes this photo really eye-catching. The lockout and the sign together provide the irony. I also like the contrast of texture between the metal sign and the brick.', '2003-10-05 15:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(439780, 39989, 12733, '<td valign="top">That is his tail, isn''t it? Cute shot, what kind of a beast is this anyway?</td>', 'That is his tail, isn''t it? Cute shot, what kind of a beast is this anyway?', '2003-10-05 15:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(439781, 39879, 12733, '<td valign="top">Actually, in terms of the standard of living at the bottom, we''ve been surpassed by a few countries - but that''s part of the irony. Nice statement.</td>', 'Actually, in terms of the standard of living at the bottom, we''ve been surpassed by a few countries - but that''s part of the irony. Nice statement.', '2003-10-05 15:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(439782, 39919, 12733, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous texture, color and framing. Who built such a window, and where?</td>', 'Gorgeous texture, color and framing. Who built such a window, and where?', '2003-10-05 15:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(439783, 40287, 12733, '<td valign="top">Cute concept, nice combination of textures in the various materials. I think it needs a LOT of cropping at the top; that bare grey doesn''t do much for the overall effect.</td>', 'Cute concept, nice combination of textures in the various materials. I think it needs a LOT of cropping at the top; that bare grey doesn''t do much for the overall effect.', '2003-10-05 15:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(439784, 39539, 10218, '<td valign="top">This is a disturbing picture.  I don''t think this falls anywhere near the borders of art.</td>', 'This is a disturbing picture.  I don''t think this falls anywhere near the borders of art.', '2003-10-05 15:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(439787, 40277, 10833, '<td valign="top">I voted a 5 here because.. it took me a long while to figure out what you were trying to accomplish..  Maybe if the tree were more prominent it would be more obvious.. Or maybe I''m just stupid :)</td>', 'I voted a 5 here because.. it took me a long while to figure out what you were trying to accomplish..  Maybe if the tree were more prominent it would be more obvious.. Or maybe I''m just stupid :)', '2003-10-05 16:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
