(441291, 39539, 7263, '<td valign="top">wow, I have seen only a handful of images thus far, but after browsing the thumbs I hope yours gets the rating it deserves!<br/> <br/>I will give it a 9, would eb a 10 but qulaity wise it''s not perfect. I would crop it some and perhaps add a little more contrast.<br/> <br/>A very brave image indeed, and hope you don''t get too many fuddy-duddys moaning about the subject. What a message indeed.<br/> <br/>Can''t wait to see who is responsible! (do hope you didn''t run the cat over for the sake of setting this up ;)<br/> <br/>Edit: Giving you a 10 now ;)<br/></td>', 'wow, I have seen only a handful of images thus far, but after browsing the thumbs I hope yours gets the rating it deserves! I will give it a 9, would eb a 10 but qulaity wise it''s not perfect. I would crop it some and perhaps add a little more contrast. A very brave image indeed, and hope you don''t get too many fuddy-duddys moaning about the subject. What a message indeed. Can''t wait to see who is responsible! (do hope you didn''t run the cat over for the sake of setting this up ;) Edit: Giving you a 10 now ;)', '2003-10-07 04:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
