(441310, 39973, 12617, '<td valign="top">I feel the lighting on the left of the chips box is a bit harsh, it looks as if theres a bright halo along the edge, and also the reflection on the top of the can is overexposed (lost the shaping on the top). Other than that the lighting is nice along the edges of the can and chip box, nicely positioned, and I like the cropping.  Fits very well.  The border is nice.  --8</td>', 'I feel the lighting on the left of the chips box is a bit harsh, it looks as if theres a bright halo along the edge, and also the reflection on the top of the can is overexposed (lost the shaping on the top). Other than that the lighting is nice along the edges of the can and chip box, nicely positioned, and I like the cropping.  Fits very well.  The border is nice.  --8', '2003-10-07 05:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
