(441315, 40136, 12617, '<td valign="top">Lightings not too bad, wou''dve been better if there wasn''t a shadow on the paper below, and the back be slightly more out of focus.  Photo needs the title to see the irony in it, which loses a few points from me, also I''m not sure what it is, but the edge of the gun is much whiter on the page below, which adds too much contrast to the edge. I like the slight smoke comming from it aswell. a subtle adition and does the image well.  --7</td>', 'Lightings not too bad, wou''dve been better if there wasn''t a shadow on the paper below, and the back be slightly more out of focus.  Photo needs the title to see the irony in it, which loses a few points from me, also I''m not sure what it is, but the edge of the gun is much whiter on the page below, which adds too much contrast to the edge. I like the slight smoke comming from it aswell. a subtle adition and does the image well.  --7', '2003-10-07 05:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
