(441325, 39958, 6172, '<td valign="top">That''s too funny!  My biggest problem with this photo is the way that pine tree is distracting in the background, too  bad it''s there!   I wish the frame were larger in this photo - you know, you''re allowed 150kb, you should use it all!  What I really like about this photo is the colors, the two colors on the sign are the same as the colors in the sky and the mountain in the back.  Very cool photo, and meets the challenge very well, as so many in this challenge don''t!</td>', 'That''s too funny!  My biggest problem with this photo is the way that pine tree is distracting in the background, too  bad it''s there!   I wish the frame were larger in this photo - you know, you''re allowed 150kb, you should use it all!  What I really like about this photo is the colors, the two colors on the sign are the same as the colors in the sky and the mountain in the back.  Very cool photo, and meets the challenge very well, as so many in this challenge don''t!', '2003-10-07 05:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
