(441730, 40178, 12809, '<td valign="top">I think the concept is good for this challenge type.  The background (chair and  bench(?) ) and the print on the tablecloth are distracting to me.  Perhaps taking the picture with only a plain table as the background would''ve worked better.  My only other suggestion would be some ''tweaking'' is a photo program to brighten this up a bit, enhance the colors, and a little unsharp mask.  Not a bad try, though.</td>', 'I think the concept is good for this challenge type.  The background (chair and  bench(?) ) and the print on the tablecloth are distracting to me.  Perhaps taking the picture with only a plain table as the background would''ve worked better.  My only other suggestion would be some ''tweaking'' is a photo program to brighten this up a bit, enhance the colors, and a little unsharp mask.  Not a bad try, though.', '2003-10-07 19:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(441734, 39539, 12809, '<td valign="top">Wow, umm, yuck! lol  <br/> <br/>My reaction went like this... "Eww, that''s sick!" while remembering I''m a cat lover.  Then I think to myself, "That IS a cat, right?!"  Then I notice the faint lines in the road and then the tire track imprints still noticeable and let out another, "Eww!"  Then I realize I need to read the title.  "HAhahahahaa!  That''s too d*mn funny!!"  :-D :-D  Thanks for the laughs!<br/> <br/>So, umm, I guess I don''t have a ''real'' critique on this, but it''s a hilarious picture with a very appropriate title for this theme!  :-)</td>', 'Wow, umm, yuck! lol   My reaction went like this... "Eww, that''s sick!" while remembering I''m a cat lover.  Then I think to myself, "That IS a cat, right?!"  Then I notice the faint lines in the road and then the tire track imprints still noticeable and let out another, "Eww!"  Then I realize I need to read the title.  "HAhahahahaa!  That''s too d*mn funny!!"  :-D :-D  Thanks for the laughs! So, umm, I guess I don''t have a ''real'' critique on this, but it''s a hilarious picture with a very appropriate title for this theme!  :-)', '2003-10-07 19:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(441736, 39973, 12809, '<td valign="top">Very nice and fits the theme well.  So many people do just that!  My only comments (and take them as you wish as I''m hardly a pro) would be to fit the rest of the "C" in the picture and also the tops of the fries.</td>', 'Very nice and fits the theme well.  So many people do just that!  My only comments (and take them as you wish as I''m hardly a pro) would be to fit the rest of the "C" in the picture and also the tops of the fries.', '2003-10-07 19:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(441738, 40192, 12809, '<td valign="top">Strange, but yet kind of cool, deck!  I like the image but I''m not really getting ''ironic'' out of it.  The deck being newer than the rest of the building?  Not sure.  Nice shot though.<br/> <br/>I bet this would look cool in b&amp;w, too.</td>', 'Strange, but yet kind of cool, deck!  I like the image but I''m not really getting ''ironic'' out of it.  The deck being newer than the rest of the building?  Not sure.  Nice shot though. I bet this would look cool in b&w, too.', '2003-10-07 19:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(441740, 40360, 12809, '<td valign="top">Nice job.  The things I''m noticing about this image are minor.  First thing I noticed was you can see the bend/corner of your background in the top right corner.  The second thing I noticed was the shadow of the matchbook.  Perhaps adjusting the lighting to another angle would prevent that.  And the last thing I noticed was that the (right) end of the cigarette is blurred.<br/> <br/>Still pretty new to photography, so take my comments as you wish. :-)  Hope they help though.</td>', 'Nice job.  The things I''m noticing about this image are minor.  First thing I noticed was you can see the bend/corner of your background in the top right corner.  The second thing I noticed was the shadow of the matchbook.  Perhaps adjusting the lighting to another angle would prevent that.  And the last thing I noticed was that the (right) end of the cigarette is blurred. Still pretty new to photography, so take my comments as you wish. :-)  Hope they help though.', '2003-10-07 19:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(441744, 39917, 12809, '<td valign="top">Funny marker.  It''s too bad the type is a little hard to read.  Not sure what you could do differently with this pic, but the dirt and few blades of grass aren''t helping this much.  I wish there was something (flowers maybe?) around it that could brighten this up a bit.  Maybe black and white would''ve worked better...I dunno.</td>', 'Funny marker.  It''s too bad the type is a little hard to read.  Not sure what you could do differently with this pic, but the dirt and few blades of grass aren''t helping this much.  I wish there was something (flowers maybe?) around it that could brighten this up a bit.  Maybe black and white would''ve worked better...I dunno.', '2003-10-07 19:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(441746, 40168, 12809, '<td valign="top">I really like this one.  It''s very simple, clean, and to the point.  Great job.</td>', 'I really like this one.  It''s very simple, clean, and to the point.  Great job.', '2003-10-07 19:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
