(441754, 40177, 12809, '<td valign="top">This is great!  Very clever idea.<br/> <br/>I really like how you cropped out the the man''s eyes; I just wish it didn''t mean losing the tip of the antenna with it.<br/> <br/>Did you draw the face on the cigs?  I sense some serious artistic talent there. :-D ;-)  (I''m picking!)  <br/> <br/>Great shot!</td>', 'This is great!  Very clever idea. I really like how you cropped out the the man''s eyes; I just wish it didn''t mean losing the tip of the antenna with it. Did you draw the face on the cigs?  I sense some serious artistic talent there. :-D ;-)  (I''m picking!)   Great shot!', '2003-10-07 19:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
