(441756, 40123, 12809, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I like how you desaturated the pic and left the purple.<br/> <br/>I see this has been validated - Just curious how you managed the "shine" legally?</td>', 'Great shot.  I like how you desaturated the pic and left the purple. I see this has been validated - Just curious how you managed the "shine" legally?', '2003-10-07 19:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
