(441759, 40179, 12809, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of the bird.  However, it''s seems like a stretch on the theme since there isn''t really anything ironic about the picture itself.<br/> <br/>If this were in the flight contest I probably would''ve given it a 4 or 5.  The crop seems a big tight to me.  Also the line in the background cuts right through the bird.  Depending on what the original looks like, I wouldn''t have cropped so tight, would''ve placed the bird in one of the right corners (to give it room to ''fly'') to follow the Rule of Thirds a little better.<br/> <br/>Overall, decent shot, though.</td>', 'Nice shot of the bird.  However, it''s seems like a stretch on the theme since there isn''t really anything ironic about the picture itself. If this were in the flight contest I probably would''ve given it a 4 or 5.  The crop seems a big tight to me.  Also the line in the background cuts right through the bird.  Depending on what the original looks like, I wouldn''t have cropped so tight, would''ve placed the bird in one of the right corners (to give it room to ''fly'') to follow the Rule of Thirds a little better. Overall, decent shot, though.', '2003-10-07 20:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(441763, 40221, 12809, '<td valign="top">Great setup!  Like the way you cropped this, too.</td>', 'Great setup!  Like the way you cropped this, too.', '2003-10-07 20:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(441764, 40191, 12809, '<td valign="top">The background is too busy.  Also, the iron idea seems to be a popular one this time.<br/> <br/>Nice try, though.</td>', 'The background is too busy.  Also, the iron idea seems to be a popular one this time. Nice try, though.', '2003-10-07 20:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(441768, 39510, 12809, '<td valign="top">Nice idea for a shot.<br/> <br/>First, this is much too blurry.  The red in the background is pixelated and at the base of it it appears to be glowing blue. (Caused by over-sharpening?)  The line created where the red ends and the white begins ''cuts through'' the picture - right through the Coke and the wine glass.  I believe the crop could have been made better by including all of the spoon, the fork, and the wine glass.<br/> <br/>Nice try, though.</td>', 'Nice idea for a shot. First, this is much too blurry.  The red in the background is pixelated and at the base of it it appears to be glowing blue. (Caused by over-sharpening?)  The line created where the red ends and the white begins ''cuts through'' the picture - right through the Coke and the wine glass.  I believe the crop could have been made better by including all of the spoon, the fork, and the wine glass. Nice try, though.', '2003-10-07 20:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(441772, 40015, 12809, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately this doesn''t look real enough for me.  The water is very white while the milk has a yellowish tint to it.  The glass of milk isn''t blending in with the picture very well because of that color difference and because of the overall texture of the image - the photo isn''t as clear as the glass of milk and the photo is grainy.<br/> <br/>I think the idea is interesting and original, though.  Nice try.</td>', 'Unfortunately this doesn''t look real enough for me.  The water is very white while the milk has a yellowish tint to it.  The glass of milk isn''t blending in with the picture very well because of that color difference and because of the overall texture of the image - the photo isn''t as clear as the glass of milk and the photo is grainy. I think the idea is interesting and original, though.  Nice try.', '2003-10-07 20:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(441775, 40038, 2158, '<td valign="top">I wish you hadn''t cut the top of his head off.</td>', 'I wish you hadn''t cut the top of his head off.', '2003-10-07 20:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(441776, 40227, 12809, '<td valign="top">Ware-Wulf...heh, funny!<br/> <br/>As for critique, I''m wondering if you used curves (or similar) to adjust the colors of the image.  The pine needles seem extremely orange and not real too me.  They are colors that fall leaves would typically be; not pine.  (not that I''ve seen anyway!)<br/> <br/>Nice catch.</td>', 'Ware-Wulf...heh, funny! As for critique, I''m wondering if you used curves (or similar) to adjust the colors of the image.  The pine needles seem extremely orange and not real too me.  They are colors that fall leaves would typically be; not pine.  (not that I''ve seen anyway!) Nice catch.', '2003-10-07 20:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(441778, 40274, 12809, '<td valign="top">The cow doesn''t seem to concerned...and I''m not sure I would''ve gotten out to move him, either!<br/> <br/>Nice shot.<br/> <br/>It would''ve been funny if you titled this "Moooove it".  ;-)</td>', 'The cow doesn''t seem to concerned...and I''m not sure I would''ve gotten out to move him, either! Nice shot. It would''ve been funny if you titled this "Moooove it".  ;-)', '2003-10-07 20:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(441784, 39879, 12809, '<td valign="top">This could use some color enhancement.  The colors aren''t vibrant, they seem washed out.  In fact, the leaves in the background almost look gray.  Were you trying to desaturate the pic and leave only red and skin color?  A bit of unsharp mask would''ve helped this too.<br/> <br/>Nice shot, though.</td>', 'This could use some color enhancement.  The colors aren''t vibrant, they seem washed out.  In fact, the leaves in the background almost look gray.  Were you trying to desaturate the pic and leave only red and skin color?  A bit of unsharp mask would''ve helped this too. Nice shot, though.', '2003-10-07 20:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(441786, 40028, 12809, '<td valign="top">I''m still new to photography...  I don''t ''get'' this? :-/  I certainly won''t take off for me not understanding.  I really like this shot and the way it''s cropped.</td>', 'I''m still new to photography...  I don''t ''get'' this? :-/  I certainly won''t take off for me not understanding.  I really like this shot and the way it''s cropped.', '2003-10-07 20:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
