(441794, 40131, 12809, '<td valign="top">I feel the use of an actual iron has been overused this contest.  However, this is an EXCELLENT shot.  Very well photographed, nice black background, and wrapping the cord adds enough to make it an interesting picture. <br/> <br/>One extremely minor thing I see is the shine of the corner of something (?) in the bottom right corner.<br/> <br/>It''s not easy making an overused object stand out from the pack.  Nice work! <br/> <br/>~ 9 ~</td>', 'I feel the use of an actual iron has been overused this contest.  However, this is an EXCELLENT shot.  Very well photographed, nice black background, and wrapping the cord adds enough to make it an interesting picture.  One extremely minor thing I see is the shine of the corner of something (?) in the bottom right corner. It''s not easy making an overused object stand out from the pack.  Nice work!  ~ 9 ~', '2003-10-07 20:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(441796, 40169, 12809, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.<br/> <br/>This is a bit blah, though.  There''s not much color in there to liven it up.  The flash (?) has created a large, blinding shine/spot at the bottom.  Also, I think the blade of the knife usually faces the plate.  Maybe a different angle would''ve helped this pic.<br/> <br/>Nice attempt, though.</td>', 'Nice concept. This is a bit blah, though.  There''s not much color in there to liven it up.  The flash (?) has created a large, blinding shine/spot at the bottom.  Also, I think the blade of the knife usually faces the plate.  Maybe a different angle would''ve helped this pic. Nice attempt, though.', '2003-10-07 20:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(441799, 40125, 12809, '<td valign="top">The banana is too orange to be a banana.  Was that what you were making part of the ironic part?  I think leaving it yellow would work better.  Also, there are reminants of color just below the foot and also around the ankle of the foot.<br/> <br/>Nice setup, though.</td>', 'The banana is too orange to be a banana.  Was that what you were making part of the ironic part?  I think leaving it yellow would work better.  Also, there are reminants of color just below the foot and also around the ankle of the foot. Nice setup, though.', '2003-10-07 20:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
