(486063, 39539, 13781, '<td valign="top">i love this photograph and...<br/>you''re totally right about the baby bird. not as good as your cat. i don''t know..it was a snapshot. i saw it, and took it for a friend, who was into photographing roadkill. it was in the middle of a paved basketball court in a park. i have no idea what is coming out of it''s mouth...<br/>i think that people would rather see flowers than this stuff..<br/>personally, that REALLY bores me. i''d rather not tamper with the photograph at all. if it''s good, it''s good...otherwise, there''s just something about changing them...<br/>anyway..the cat is incredible. i really love it. nice work:)</td>', 'i love this photograph and...you''re totally right about the baby bird. not as good as your cat. i don''t know..it was a snapshot. i saw it, and took it for a friend, who was into photographing roadkill. it was in the middle of a paved basketball court in a park. i have no idea what is coming out of it''s mouth...i think that people would rather see flowers than this stuff..personally, that REALLY bores me. i''d rather not tamper with the photograph at all. if it''s good, it''s good...otherwise, there''s just something about changing them...anyway..the cat is incredible. i really love it. nice work:)', '2003-11-15 04:31:27.000000', NULL, 0),
