(540220, 40221, 10799, '<td valign="top">I guess I should say that this was a set up.  I used to work as a Driver''s Improvement Instructor and I often thought how ironic it would be if I would ever get careless and get a ticket after all the emphasis I put on paying attention to your speed and not speeding.  The office giving the ticket was this lady''s husband and he said he would love to help out.  He is very tall so it was hard to get all of him and her in one photo.</td>', 'I guess I should say that this was a set up.  I used to work as a Driver''s Improvement Instructor and I often thought how ironic it would be if I would ever get careless and get a ticket after all the emphasis I put on paying attention to your speed and not speeding.  The office giving the ticket was this lady''s husband and he said he would love to help out.  He is very tall so it was hard to get all of him and her in one photo.', '2004-01-12 19:37:23.000000', NULL, 0),
