(676739, 40346, 16269, '<td valign="top">I love this idea! hehehe... I actually drink both pepsi AND coke.. diet and regular... just whatever''s on sale or available. But still. It''s always fun to tease Corporate America! I wonder what it would have looked like with a black background rather than a white one. I''m not partial to the "white sheet" look, although I like how the lightbox lit up the can. Or maybe that was one of the other lighting sources lighting it? Hehe.. I don''t know. But I like it.</td>', 'I love this idea! hehehe... I actually drink both pepsi AND coke.. diet and regular... just whatever''s on sale or available. But still. It''s always fun to tease Corporate America! I wonder what it would have looked like with a black background rather than a white one. I''m not partial to the "white sheet" look, although I like how the lightbox lit up the can. Or maybe that was one of the other lighting sources lighting it? Hehe.. I don''t know. But I like it.', '2004-04-20 01:07:25.000000', NULL, 0),
