(780636, 40362, 23362, '<td valign="top">If you''d like to see how another photographer made basically the same picture ten years back look up the archives of the Detroit Free Press, Magazine section for fall fashions, 1993. The photographer was Steve Nickerson. The biggest difference, I see, between your photo and Steve''s pic was Steve did his photographic illustration for the fashion section as the person tied to the roof of the car was a model wearing Calvin Klein clothing. His picture drew many complaints from the readership... they wrote protestsing letters for weeks bringing about an apology from the Executive editor Heath Meriwether. Also, the same picture may be seen on the cover of The National Press Photographers Assoc. NEWS PHOTOGRAPHER magazine dated February 1994. (Story on page 33).</td>', 'If you''d like to see how another photographer made basically the same picture ten years back look up the archives of the Detroit Free Press, Magazine section for fall fashions, 1993. The photographer was Steve Nickerson. The biggest difference, I see, between your photo and Steve''s pic was Steve did his photographic illustration for the fashion section as the person tied to the roof of the car was a model wearing Calvin Klein clothing. His picture drew many complaints from the readership... they wrote protestsing letters for weeks bringing about an apology from the Executive editor Heath Meriwether. Also, the same picture may be seen on the cover of The National Press Photographers Assoc. NEWS PHOTOGRAPHER magazine dated February 1994. (Story on page 33).', '2004-06-26 15:33:51.000000', NULL, 0),
